---
---
<section class="section" id="work">
  <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
    <p class="caption"><span class="sec-index">05</span>Selected work — 2024 → 2026</p>
    <h2>Work that ships,<br />not decks<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">Full-stack apps, hackathon builds and experiments — pulled live from GitHub, each one designed, built and shipped end to end.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="pin-layout">
    <aside class="pin-left" data-reveal>
      <p class="caption">Featured work</p>
      <div class="pin-index"><span id="pinCurrent">01</span><small> / 06</small></div>
      <div class="pin-bar"><div id="pinProgress"></div></div>
      <p>Live from GitHub — top repositories by stars, most recent push breaks ties. Scroll to walk through each one.</p>
    </aside>

    <div class="project-list work-list">
      <article class="work-row" data-reveal data-project-index="0">
        <div class="work-idx">01<b>//06</b></div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="work-title"><a href="https://github.com/HarshKumar30/Portfolio" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Portfolio Website</a></h3>
          <p class="work-brief">Fully responsive single-page app showcasing projects, skills and background. Theme system, SEO best practices, GitHub Pages + Actions CI/CD, reusable component architecture, mobile-first layout.</p>
          <div class="work-tags"><span class="tag">Astro</span><span class="tag">TypeScript</span><span class="tag">CI/CD</span><span class="tag">SEO</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="work-side">
          <span class="work-meta">2025 // Web</span>
          <a class="work-link" href="https://github.com/HarshKumar30/Portfolio" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View code ↗</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="work-row" data-reveal data-project-index="1">
        <div class="work-idx">02<b>//06</b></div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="work-title"><a href="https://github.com/HarshKumar30" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Task Tracker</a></h3>
          <p class="work-brief">Full-stack task manager — Python backend with a dynamic JS frontend. Normalized schema, optimized filter and sort queries, RESTful JSON API, drag-and-drop reorder, deadline highlighting.</p>
          <div class="work-tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Flask</span><span class="tag">SQLite</span><span class="tag">REST API</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="work-side">
          <span class="work-meta">2025 // Full-stack</span>
          <a class="work-link" href="https://github.com/HarshKumar30" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View code ↗</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="work-row" data-reveal data-project-index="2">
        <div class="work-idx">03<b>//06</b></div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="work-title">LPG Leakage Detection</h3>
          <p class="work-brief">Arduino / ESP32 sensor rig with real-time alerts. Designed and demoed in 24 hours.</p>
          <div class="work-tags"><span class="tag">IoT</span><span class="tag">Arduino</span><span class="tag">ESP32</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="work-side">
          <span class="work-meta">Hackathon</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="work-row" data-reveal data-project-index="3">
        <div class="work-idx">04<b>//06</b></div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="work-title">Doc Security Suite</h3>
          <p class="work-brief">Steganography plus cryptographic signing for tamper-proof documents.</p>
          <div class="work-tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Crypto</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="work-side">
          <span class="work-meta">Hackathon</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="work-row" data-reveal data-project-index="4">
        <div class="work-idx">05<b>//06</b></div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="work-title">Eye-Tracking Keyboard</h3>
          <p class="work-brief">Assistive keyboard powered by in-browser gaze prediction.</p>
          <div class="work-tags"><span class="tag">JavaScript</span><span class="tag">WebGazer.js</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="work-side">
          <span class="work-meta">Hackathon</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="work-row" data-reveal data-project-index="5">
        <div class="work-idx">06<b>//06</b></div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="work-title">Time-Series Prediction</h3>
          <p class="work-brief">LSTM and Transformer architectures for market forecasting.</p>
          <div class="work-tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">LSTM</span><span class="tag">Transformer</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="work-side">
          <span class="work-meta">Lab // ML</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="heatmap-wrap gh-wrap" data-reveal id="ghActivity" hidden>
    <div class="hm-head">
      <p>GITHUB COMMITS — LAST 90 DAYS</p>
      <div class="hm-legend"><span>Less</span><i class="lv0"></i><i class="lv1"></i><i class="lv2"></i><i class="lv3"></i><i class="lv4"></i><span>More</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="heatmap-scroll">
      <div class="hm-months" id="ghMonths" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="heatmap" id="ghHeatmap" role="img" aria-label="GitHub commit activity heatmap"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="hm-meta" id="ghMeta"></p>
  </div>

  <script src="../scripts/github.ts"></script>
  <script src="../scripts/activity.ts"></script>
</section>
